---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="展厅一：时间线" description="从1930到2018 · 跨越近百年的人生轨迹">
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="wax-seal"></div>
    <h1>展厅一：时间线</h1>
    <p>从1930到2018 · 跨越近百年的人生轨迹</p>
  </section>

  <div class="content">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">← 返回入口</a>

    <!-- 阶段一：故土与离别 -->
    <div class="divider"><span>故土与离别 · 1930–1948</span></div>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">1930年</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">叶淑柔出生于汕头澄海溪头村。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">1932年</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">谢南枝出生于暹罗（今泰国）。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">1945年</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">抗日战争胜利后的汕头游神盛会上，郑木生与叶淑柔在木棉树下初遇，一见钟情，后私奔。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">1946年</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">淑柔生下一女二子：大妹、大弟、细弟。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">1948年</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">木生为躲避战乱抓壮丁，告别妻小下南洋赴暹罗。临行前将花杆放在枕头箱里。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 阶段二：暹罗与变故 -->
    <div class="divider"><span>暹罗与变故 · 1950–1960</span></div>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">1950年代初</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">木生初到暹罗，被拽下水，开始寄平安批回国。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">1955年</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">木生辗转来到暹罗，入客栈结识南枝。中秋节客栈遭纵火，木生火场救南枝父，后殴打纵火者入狱。南枝开始替木生给淑柔写信、寄钱，同时刷碗、洗衣服、打零工维持生计。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">1958年</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">木生出狱，得狱中贵人资助，开始跑船。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">1960年</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">木生跑船出事故，身亡。南枝本欲寄讣告，最终决定隐瞒真相，以木生名义继续通信、寄钱。同年在河边捡到养子泽华。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 阶段三：隐瞒与代笔 -->
    <div class="divider"><span>隐瞒与代笔 · 1960–1978</span></div>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">1960–1978年</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">南枝以木生名义与淑柔通信长达十八年，持续寄钱。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">1978年</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">南枝决定向淑柔坦白，欲回国前父亲离世。南枝寄去坦白长信与照片，因邮差落水，信件遗失。淑柔收到照片后误会，搬离溪头村。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">1979年</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">南枝多次去信被退回，批局关闭，二人彻底断联。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 阶段四：断联与重逢 -->
    <div class="divider"><span>断联与重逢 · 1979–2018</span></div>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">2000年</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">南枝失忆前写下最后一封长信。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">2018年</div>
        <div class="timeline-text">淑柔88岁大寿，孙子叶晓伟赴泰，意外解开四十年误会。淑柔乘机赴暹罗，与南枝重逢。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="next-hall">
      <a href="/gallery/people" class="back-link">下一展厅：展厅二 · 那些人 →</a>
    </div>

    <footer class="footer">
      <p>所有内容来自剧组一手采访 · 路演 · 节目 · 杂志</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 4px; opacity: 0.6;">《给阿嬷的情书》DEAR YOU · 蓝鸿春导演作品</p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
